# MillOS — local environment configuration
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development. `.env.local` is gitignored.
#
# There is no build-time AI API key. Enter your own Anthropic or OpenAI key in
# the in-app AI settings for Haiku 5.5 High or Luna 6 High. Keys remain in page
# memory until reload, and plant telemetry goes directly to the selected provider.
# The on-device WebGPU model requires no key.

# Enable the service worker during local development.
# (Production builds register it automatically; leave unset for normal `npm run dev`.)
# VITE_ENABLE_SW=true
